        "original_id": "ef6d88ca-b80b-5ef9-a47b-99e4a47fd284",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jools Holland, Cerys Matthews, Toby Jepson, Keith Richards\n- Albums and songs: Choke, \"Out of Time\", \"Big River\"\n- Charts and places: UK Albums Chart, Northern Ireland\n\nFacts:\n- In 1997, Choke by The Beautiful South reached number 2 on the UK Albums Chart.\n- The song credited with helping push Choke to number 2 was \"Out of Time.\"\n- \"Out of Time\" is a duet by Jools Holland and Cerys Matthews.\n- Cerys Matthews is Welsh, not Northern Irish.\n- Keith Richards duets with Toby Jepson on \"Big River.\"\n- Keith Richards is English, and Toby Jepson is also not Northern Irish.",
